<title>SINGAPORE: EsSo Singapore shuts 110,000-bpd crude unit.</title>
<headline>EsSo Singapore shuts 110,000-bpd crude unit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esso Singapore has shut its 110,000-barrel-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit (CDU) on Wednesday, an Esso spokeswoman said.</p>
</text>
